      "Language": "chi",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Percutaneous coronary intervention has been the main effective method for coronary heart disease recently, but the post-operative complications became the main factors to limit its curative effect. Considering the understanding on traditional Chinese medicine (TCM) syndromes of post-interventional therapy and the advance of pharmaceutical research we suggest that evolution law of TCM syndrome types should be hold intensively and practical therapies and formulae should be established under the guidance of TCM basic theory."},
